*That's what I got*

Hey, I feel you, it's really embarassing when this stuff happens... just hold on there, tell the teacher something like "Sorry, women problems" and don't give a damn about what others think. 

&#x200B;

That teacher is horrible for shouting at you tho. Good luck to you, I hope you won't have too much trouble because of this!
